#! case: a misplaced Plan is reported once and left out, so its Statements cause nothing
#! rule: R15_08-misused-assigned-or-removed

GAME CUE food_served
CUE welcome
ACTION bow

PLAYBOOK Dining:
    WHEN welcome: DO bow.

PLOT Banquet:
    ROLE Guest.
    PHASE reception INITIAL.

    DURING reception:
        WHEN food_served:
            ASSIGN Dining TO Guest.
        WHEN ASSIGNED:                   #! error R15_08-misused-assigned-or-removed
            TELL Guest welcome.
